Let $(P,\le_P)$ and $(Q,\le_Q)$ be locally finite posets. Define the **product order** on $P\times Q$ by

$$(p,q)\le(p',q')\quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad p\le_Pp'\text{ and }q\le_Qq'.$$

